# Workflow: HelloWorld

## Description
A simple hello world demonstration of the aiCompiler language.

## Inputs
- name: the name to greet (optional, defaults to "World")

## Tools
- console: standard output

## Steps

### 1. GenerateGreeting
Say hello to {name} in a creative and inspiring way.
Include a short motivational quote about the future of
intent-driven programming and AI as the CPU.

### 2. PrintOutput
Print the greeting and quote to the console.
Format it beautifully with a border.
If console fails, log the error but do not halt.
